{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object seen, move to it and take it. Check object properties, then perform specific task. Always scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectSeen    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />\"",
